        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Sword Art Online: Infinity Moment",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Sword Art Online: Infinity Moment is a Japanese role-playing game based on the Sword Art Online light novel series. The gameplay has many similarities to MMORPGs, though it is not an online game, including the ability to buy and upgrade weapons, go on missions, and fight in a group with other characters. The game follows an alternate storyline from the end of the first arc of the original story, in which a glitch causes Kirito and the other players to remain in Sword Art Online despite defeating Heathcliff, and players from other VMMORPGs such as Leafa and Sinon get sucked into the game themselves. Its sequel game Sword Art Online: Hollow Fragment includes all its content.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Sword Art Online: Infinity Moment es un videojuego japonés de rol basado en la serie de novelas ligeras Sword Art Online. Su jugabilidad tiene muchas similitudes con los MMORPG, aunque no es un juego en línea; incluye la posibilidad de comprar y mejorar armas, realizar misiones y luchar en grupo con otros personajes. El juego sigue una línea argumental alternativa a partir del final del primer arco de la historia original: un fallo hace que Kirito y los demás jugadores permanezcan en Sword Art Online tras derrotar a Heathcliff, y jugadores de otros VMMORPG, como Leafa y Sinon, quedan atrapados en el juego. Su secuela, Sword Art Online: Hollow Fragment, incluye todo su contenido.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2013",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
